{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cold walls. An empty room. A missing sister\u2026 Chloe has no choice but to unravel this mystery\u2014no matter how difficult it may be to move forward.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chloe, a young girl with a disability, and her older sister Kamila have faced many hardships. Despite everything, Kamila has always done her best to help Chloe reclaim a sense of normalcy. But now, Kamila is gone, and Chloe is trapped in a crumbling house filled with eerie silence and unanswered questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a haunting visual novel where the bond between two sisters is tested by an unknown force. As Chloe searches for a way out, she must navigate eerie rooms, uncover hidden objects, and piece together the secrets buried deep within these walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every discovery, memories resurface, unveiling the complex relationship between the sisters and the hidden truths of their family's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you escape? And more importantly\u2014can you uncover what truly happened to Kamila?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Multiple locations</strong> \u2013 Each scene pulls you deeper into the game's immersive atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Item search</strong> \u2013 Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, and use them to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Gradual story unveiling</strong> \u2013 No clear answers at the start\u2014the mystery unfolds step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> \u2013 Tense, haunting melodies heighten the suspense and intrigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Retro screen-to-screen exploration</strong> \u2013 The core gameplay embraces an old-school visual novel structure, where players move between static screens, uncovering clues and memories one scene at a time. This deliberate pacing enhances immersion and emotional tension.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Early escape!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/c8c01094f57d98793839cfe23eab5a8d7e9ee28c.jpg"},{"name":"I am alive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/4fcf061780ad63db82eac9d8a029800789595041.jpg"},{"name":"Together!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/1d33999fc70909212811c63b03a5adf41e5f8281.jpg"},{"name":"My sister...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/2a2f2e2bae1272b35c8fce10cafe4a2843828801.jpg"},{"name":"Attentive.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/9bf047a4eff6ed288f7635cd61d82f443d45c5d6.jpg"},{"name":"Headstrong!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/e8445e954e8e6f94a3813eefd5d20195f83c6d75.jpg"},{"name":"Revelation.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3585640/2e9187b54e166770275d6daa54c2c24af105ddeb.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585640?t=1774140239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585640?t=1774140239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585640/126c7e0013d8e43be5b7070ac2cd3136828dc7bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774140239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585640/126c7e0013d8e43be5b7070ac2cd3136828dc7bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774140239","categories":[